<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-E.P. BEAT BOLAND BY SIX WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-E.P. BEAT BOLAND BY SIX WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>PAARL 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eastern Province scored 181 for four</p>
<p>wickets to beat Boland by six wickets on the fourth and final</p>
<p>day of their Supersport Series match at Boland Park on</p>
<p>Wednesday.</p>
<p>Openers Michael Beamish and Carl Bradfield laid the platform</p>
<p>with a first wicket stand of 70 while Louis Koen provided the</p>
<p>only exciting stroke play of an otherwise suffocatingly slow</p>
<p>match with an unbeaten 40 from just 39 deliveries.</p>
<p>Boland first innings 204 </p>
<p>Eastern Province first innings 262</p>
<p>Boland second innings 237</p>
<p>Eastern Province second innings</p>
<p>    M.Beamish c Brink b Vorster	   76</p>
<p>    C.Bradfield lbw b Truter		23</p>
<p>    K.Wessels c Truter b Vorster	  27</p>
<p>    L.Koen not out			    40</p>
<p>    D.Callaghan lbw b Vorster		0</p>
<p>    M.Rushmere not out			 2</p>
<p>    Extras					13</p>
<p>Total (for four wickets in 68.5 overs) 181</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-70 2-134 3-139 4-139</p>
<p>Bowling: Williams 8-3-14-0, Albanie 6-2-12-0, Henderson</p>
<p>17-5-24-0, Kuiper 6-1-19-0, Vorster 12-4-44-3, Truter</p>
<p>19.5-1-58-1</p>
<p>Result: E.P. won by six wickets</p>
<p>Points: E.P. 16, Boland 5.</p>
<p>    Extras					6</p>
<p>Total (for no wicket in 12 overs)  17</p>
<p>Bowling: Williams 4-1-6-0, Albanie 3-1-3-0, Henderson</p>
<p>4-2-2-0, Kuiper 1-0-1-0.</p>
</text>
